# ==============================================================================
# Royal Pakistani Wedding Invitation - Environment Variables
# ==============================================================================
# Optional: Supabase configuration for persistent cloud-stored prayers/guestbook.
# If omitted or invalid, the website seamlessly falls back to local browser storage
# so the application remains 100% operational out-of-the-box.
#
# Obtain these credentials from Supabase Dashboard > Project Settings > API:
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-supabase-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-public-anon-key-here
